{"kind": "mod", "id": 2785, "name": "ReceiveAllChats", "slug": "receiveallchats", "teaser": "Makes the \"Receive all\" button actually receive all attachments from all chats", "owner_name": "maschine", "downloads": 2042, "favourites": 16, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": true, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.maschine.receiveallchats", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Tools", "category_id": 1, "updated_at": "2026-08-09T18:02:46.000000Z", "created_at": "2026-06-28T11:48:33.000000Z", "published_at": "2026-06-28T11:51:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1.0", "latest_version": "2.0.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<h2>Overview</h2>\n<p>A simple mod that makes the “Receive all” button in the messenger actually collect all attachments from all chats.<br />\nParticularly useful for users of the mod <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2655/stat-rewards\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Stat Rewards by Chazut</a> who constantly have to collect lots of attachments.</p>\n<p>Thanks to the new server component, retrieval now happens instantly, regardless of the number of messages.</p>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<p>As usual, unzip to your SPT directory</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Let me know if you run into any problems or have suggestions for improvement.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.9", "content_length": 24191, "downloads": 494, "published_at": "2026-07-30T09:40:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2785/receiveallchats/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.1.0", "content_length": 24701, "downloads": 194, "published_at": "2026-08-09T08:52:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https:/